## Planned Motion Detection Architecture

### Stage 1

Motion-triggered snapshots.

Pipeline:

```text
Camera
    ↓
Frame comparison
    ↓
Motion detected
    ↓
Save image
```

Advantages:

- Very low CPU usage
- Minimal storage consumption
- Fast implementation

---

### Stage 2

Introduce object detection.

Pipeline:

```text
Motion detected
    ↓
Capture snapshot
    ↓
YOLOv8
    ↓
Species classification
```

Target classes:

- Possum
- Rat
- Stoat
- Ferret
- Hedgehog
- Cat
- Dog
- Bird
- Human

---

### Stage 3

Notification system.

Pipeline:

